! Project 02 catalogue. One material, copied verbatim from Zemax INFRARED.AGF (SILICON,
! Salzberg & Villa, JOSA 47, 244 (1957)), with ONE change: the lower wavelength limit (LD)
! is extended from 1.36 um to 1.30 um so it can be evaluated at the 1.31 um design wavelength.
! This is a 50 nm extrapolation of the Sellmeier fit; n(1.31 um) = 3.5039. See docs/validation.md.
CC Project 02: SILICON with LD extended to 1.30 um
